+	  When enabled, this option ensures the value of SIGNAL_SET_SIZE is at least
+	  CONFIG_THREAD_CANCEL_SIGNAL_NUMBER + 2 (Linux NPTL: reserve 32 cancel, 33 reserved).
+
+endif # THREAD_CANCEL
+
